[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753009\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing the steering wheel,\nposition the wheels as far as possible parallel to the car&#x27;s longitudinal\naxis.</p></aside><p><a href=\"#/2752777\">4110A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753184\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752983\">5550A10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt securing the steering column to the steering box.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing the steering column\nfrom the steering box, ensure the front wheels are straight.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046719.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a) and (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H1A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H1B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Aerial for Fiat-CODE</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>P91</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Release the wiring from the fastenings on the instrument panel\nbeam.</p><p>3. Undo the nuts (3a) and the rear bolts (3b).</p><p>4. Release the  steering column from the instrument panel support\nbeam and position on the floor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046720.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the mount with steering\nshafts in its seat.</p><p>Tighten the  bolts and nuts securing the\nmount with steering control shafts to the instrument facia support beam.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>STEERING SHAFT MOUNTING</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>STEERING SHAFT MOUNTING</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the bolt securing the support with\nsteering shafts to the steering box.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>STEERING SHAFT JOINT FASTENERS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.2 ÷ 4.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connections for\nthe ignition switch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H1A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H1B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Aerial for Fiat-CODE</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>P91</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752983\">5550A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753184\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752777\">4110A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753009\">5580C18</a></p><p>Connect the battery terminals.</p><p>Check the operation of the Air Bag system\nusing the Examiner or other diagnostic equipment.</p>"]]